<section class="faq-section" style="padding: 50px 0; background: #0b132b; border-bottom: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08);">
  <div class="container" style="max-width: 1000px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 0 15px;">
    <h2 style="color: #ffffff; font-size: 1.7rem; font-weight: 800; margin-bottom: 25px; text-align: center;">
      Frequently Asked Questions &bull; Bike Transport from Jaipur to Gurgaon | Safe Two-Wheeler Shifting
    </h2>
    
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How much does it cost to transport a bike from Jaipur to Gurgaon with packers and movers jaipur to gurgaon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The cost typically ranges between ₹3,500 and ₹6,500 depending on bike size, model, any additional accessories, and the level of insurance you choose. Our online quote tool calculates the exact amount instantly, factoring in fuel surcharge, distance, and any special handling requirements, ensuring you get a transparent, no‑hidden‑fee price.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What safety measures do packers and movers jaipur to gurgaon use to prevent scratches on my motorcycle?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">We employ a seven‑layer shock‑absorbent packing system, start‑to‑finish scratch guard film, and custom wooden crates for high‑value bikes. The bike is loaded onto a hydraulic ramp trailer with wheel chocks and high‑tensile ratchet lashings, then secured inside a covered truck that shields it from weather, road debris, and accidental impacts.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">How long does the bike shifting process take between Jaipur and Gurgaon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">The transit distance of roughly 274 km via NH 19 is covered in 5‑7 hours of driving time under normal traffic conditions. Including pickup, loading, documentation, and doorstep delivery, the complete end‑to‑end process usually completes within 24 hours, with real‑time updates provided throughout.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Is transit insurance mandatory for bike transport, and what does it cover?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">While not legally mandatory, we strongly recommend our 100 % IRDAI‑approved marine transit insurance. It covers accidental damage, theft, fire, and natural calamities up to the declared value of your bike. In the unlikely event of a claim, the insurance ensures full reimbursement, giving you complete peace of mind.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">Can I track my bike in real time during the Jaipur‑to‑Gurgaon journey?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">Yes. Every dedicated covered truck is equipped with GPS live‑tracking, and you receive a secure tracking link once the bike is loaded. The system shows real‑time location, estimated arrival time, and any route deviations, allowing you to stay informed from pickup in Jaipur to delivery in Gurgaon.</p>
      </div>
      <div style="margin-bottom: 14px; background: rgba(255,255,255,0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255,255,255,0.08); border-radius: 8px; padding: 16px 20px;">
        <h3 style="color: #f8fafc; font-size: 1.1rem; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 8px;">What documents are required for a hassle‑free bike relocation from Jaipur to Gurgaon?</h3>
        <p style="color: #cbd5e1; line-height: 1.7; font-size: 0.95rem; margin: 0;">You’ll need the original registration certificate (RC), a valid insurance copy, a government‑issued ID proof, and a signed packing declaration. If the move is for corporate or government reimbursement, provide the relevant purchase order or sanction letter. Our team verifies all paperwork during pickup to avoid delays.</p>
      </div>
  </div>
